--- a/codex-rs/app-server/README.md
+++ b/codex-rs/app-server/README.md
@@ -1,5 +1,12 @@
 # codex-app-server
 
+Local image-usage patch: structured image-generation items include nullable
+`usage`, preserving the standalone Images endpoint's raw token breakdowns.
+Null means the upstream did not provide usage. This is independent of thread
+model token usage and does not change outgoing image requests. Existing rollouts
+without the field remain readable. Read this field from `item/completed`;
+legacy image-generation events do not expose it.
+
 `codex app-server` is the interface Codex uses to power rich interfaces such as the [Codex VS Code extension](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=openai.chatgpt).
 
 ## Table of Contents
